WEBVTT

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:09.920
The stone tablet that can create
Sacred Beasts was stolen from Judy's lab.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:15.590
Max's friend, Allen,
conspired with the thieves.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:17.090
Go, Shoot!

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:00.380
Viper Wall!

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:01.980
What?!

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:09.850
According to Allen, the thieves were
headed back to Japan with the tablet.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:15.370
We returned to Japan to try
and get a step ahead.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.720
Old-timer!

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:42.690
Huh? The stone tablet?

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:47.430
Have you really seen
the tablet before?

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:48.570
I have.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:53.080
That was over thirty
years ago, though.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.000
Thirty years?!

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:59.120
Will you tell us the story?
Of what happened thirty years ago...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.120
Takao! Are you okay?

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:14.830
What's gotten into you?

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.140
What?

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:17.230
Ow...

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:21.650
So this was your old research
lab, Chairman Daitenji?

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.750
Indeed.

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:30.620
How did you get any research
done in a dump like this?

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.540
There it is!

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:41.910
So this is you, old man?
Not a bad look!

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.280
Who's the man next to you?

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:48.830
Doctor Zagart.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.440
My research partner.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:55.000
He was one of the best
researchers around.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.560
Did something happen to him?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:04.810
Thirty years ago, he disappeared from
this facility with a stone tablet in hand.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.720
With the stone tablet?

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:10.810
That tablet was a different one
than the one you were researching.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:15.000
We happened to find it
by chance thirty years ago.

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:21.600
At the time, we were doing
research on gyroscopes.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.170
Gyroscopes?

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:30.600
It's a device where a top spins within a frame.
A sensor that detects the motion of the object within.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:31.850
That thing?

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:39.900
We were researching how to make a gyroscope
that could maintain its balance at a high velocity.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:52.820
We stayed up night after night
creating tops from various ores

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:55.440
to repeat our experiments.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:59.860
One day, one of our researchers

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:02.720
brought in a tablet made
of an unknown material

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:06.050
that they had discovered
in their travels.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:11.590
And it looked just like the one
that got stolen from Judy's lab?

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.120
Right.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:15.040
And what of it?

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:21.290
We immediately made a top from a
piece of the tablet and ran an experiment.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:32.800
The top continued to spin and emitted
an incredible amount of energy.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.040
A Sacred Beast, right?

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:38.010
Yes. But back then we
had no idea what it was.

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:43.430
We believed that energy was the
cause of the top's stable rotation,

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:48.990
so we focused on researching the stone
tablet to track down the energy source.

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.210
Are you going to keep going?

00:06:58.210 --> 00:06:59.860
Yeah. Just a little longer.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:02.320
Don't push yourself too hard.
I'm heading out.

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:03.360
Daitenji.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.510
I believe that this...

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:11.700
Is a righteous discovery!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:22.770
See you tomorrow.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.870
The next day,

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:34.210
Zagart disappeared along with the
stone tablet and the research data.

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:38.020
What of Zagart after that?

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:39.970
Not a word.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:44.560
So he's the one who stole
the tablet from my mom's lab!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.780
We don't know that.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:51.130
But there aren't many people
who know the value of the tablet.

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:55.650
So we might learn something
if we ask Doctor Zagart?

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:59.000
Good for you, lady!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.860
We're like halfway there
to finding the tablet!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:03.520
Y-yes...

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.800
Are you making progress?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.070
Doctor Zagart.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:32.170
To think there
existed another tablet...

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:36.070
New York is probably a
mess right about now.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:41.900
But you've done a big favor to my
scientists with your plot to steal that thing.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:46.300
If you're going to praise me, save it until
after we get a Sacred Beast out of this.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:48.830
You never change.

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:52.010
Doctor! The analysis is complete.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:03.240
So many Sacred Beasts
are sealed within...

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:09.010
Doctor Zagart, our research
is finally going to pay off.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.570
--We're starting!
--Yes, ma'am!

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:15.430
Now that the digital
Sacred Beasts have failed,

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:19.070
this stone tablet is our
final ace in the hole.

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:23.010
We're going to get the Sacred Beasts
out of this, no matter what the cost.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.000
Split-and-merge system, online!

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.080
Analytical index, 5.7!

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.720
Matching coefficient, 450!

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.910
Analytical index, 7.8!

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:46.470
Matching coefficient, 870!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.570
Analytical index, 10.5!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:52.320
Matching coefficient, 1,200!

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.860
A Sacred Beast!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:16.010
Transposing system, online!

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.860
Transfer rate, fifty percent!

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:27.250
Seventy percent!

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:28.770
Ninety percent!

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:33.260
100%!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.180
Doctor Zagart!

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:56.610
This time, the four
Sacred Beasts are mine.

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:02.030
Max! Rei! Hey!

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:05.860
Where'd they go,
so early in the morning?

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.750
To the BBA?

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:12.010
Yes, they said they'd help Judy
track down Doctor Zagart.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:18.700
Dang! I finally wanna test this thing
out but there's no one to fight!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.980
Dragoon V2, yes?

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:24.630
Yeah. Max's mom
gave it an upgrade,

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:27.330
but I haven't even
battled with it once!

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:30.340
You've got someone to fight.

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:33.430
Ta-da!

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:37.150
What's with the weird Bey?

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:42.840
Watch your mouth! This is the ultimate
Beyblade that Judy and I designed!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:44.510
Come on! Let us do battle!

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:48.410
I'll go look for a real
challenge down at the BBA.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.590
Takao!

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:54.100
I feel bad for making Dragoon V2
fight something like that.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:55.960
Are you scared?

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:59.800
Scared of losing to me?

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.580
What?!

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:05.180
I totally understand, though!

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:10.970
You must want to win
Dragoon V2's first battle!

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.280
Now you've done and said it!

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:17.090
Okay! If you're gonna
talk tough I'll take you on!

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.190
I'm not pulling any punches!

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:29.110
I don't want you to!

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:31.050
--Three! Two!

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:31.860
One!

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:33.780
--Go, Shoot!

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.890
Bring it on!

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:46.320
What kind of ultimate Beyblade
jumps around like some frog?

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.300
I'll finish this in one shot!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.930
Dragoon!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:52.760
Jump!

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:58.700
What?! He dodged!

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:00.910
That's nothing!

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.110
This time for sure! Go, Dragoon!

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:08.810
Jump!

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:11.440
What?!

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:18.270
Piece of cake! Dragoon V2
is nothing to be afraid of!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.890
Darn it!

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:20.990
Dragoon!

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:31.090
Darn it! Hold still!

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:34.400
I see you've lost a
fair amount of power.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.360
And now it is my turn!

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:40.760
Einstein Attack!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:14:00.400
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:05.430
Some Einstein Attack!

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:07.360
Stop laughing!

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.900
How can you laugh at this?

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:14.740
You haven't even
mastered Dragoon V2!

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.070
What do you mean?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:22.320
Listen up. Dragoon V2 is different
from all the other Dragoons up to now.

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:25.500
Equipped with the Magne Weight Disk,

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:30.160
and combined with the MG Core, the
power output increases by several times!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:34.020
In exchange, movement
becomes harder to control.

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.810
Now that you mention...

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.980
Go, Dragoon!

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.470
You're right...

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:46.220
The attack power is
considerably higher,

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:49.250
but it's not a Beyblade
that can be controlled easily.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.770
I see. Kinomiya and
his team are back.

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.440
Faster than I thought.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:15:00.500
Goddamn! Why'd they take
a vacation to New York?

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.110
Getting cocky just because
they beat the Psykicks!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:07.610
But thanks to the Psykicks, the four
Sacred Beasts have gotten stronger.

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:09.150
He's right.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:12.890
So that means it's time for
us to make our move, Ozma.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:20.340
I just got word from
Chairman Daitenji and Judy.

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:24.040
They don't have any
leads on Doctor Zagart.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.710
So then...

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:29.140
We have no idea where
the stone tablet is.

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:32.290
By the way, where's Takao?

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:34.070
He might be by the river.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.950
The river? Why?

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.000
Go, Dragoon! Turn!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.100
Hang in there!

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:49.300
Darn, I messed up again.

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:51.480
Hiromi.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:53.740
What are you doing out here?

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:56.240
I'm practicing, obviously!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.610
With my new Dragoon V2!

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:02.700
I'm having a hard time
getting to move how I want it to.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.930
Hey, what's the big idea?

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:09.440
Don't big idea me!
Everyone is worried about the tablet,

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.470
and here you are
chilling out and practicing?

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:13.620
I'm not chilling out!

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:20.740
Nice to see you again, Kinomiya.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.360
Ozma!

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:32.270
I came back to take Seiryu,
just as promised.

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:33.060
What?!

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:35.780
Are you guys still
on about that?

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.210
Takao. You don't
need to fight them.

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.040
We can't allow that.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.700
This isn't a game for us, you know.

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:46.200
Will you accept my challenge?

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:50.630
Yeah! Takao Kinomiya
never turns down a challenge!

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:53.590
No! Dragoon V2 is still...

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:55.340
This is perfect.

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:57.860
It's a chance to
give it a real battle.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.160
But...

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:02.710
But before we battle,
tell me one thing.

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:05.470
Why are you so obsessed
with the four Sacred Beasts?

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:06.790
It's our mission.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.130
Mission?

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:10.490
To seal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:14.250
That is the mission
given to us by our clan.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.890
What do they mean?

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:18.180
I have no idea.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.280
Just who are these guys?

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:33.510
Sounds like fun! Seal, schmeal!

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.540
Try it if you can!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.630
Kyoujyu...

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:40.980
Don't bother. Takao's completely
in battle mode now.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.500
Here we go!

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.650
--Go, Shoot!

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:58.150
Wait, Dragoon!

00:17:58.580 --> 00:17:59.900
Leopard!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:09.300
Darn! My Beyblade won't
move like I want it to!

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:10.620
Kyoujyu!

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:14.630
Takao hasn't mastered Dragoon V2 yet!

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:18.330
What's the matter?

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:20.610
Is that all you've
got, Takao Kinomiya?

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:27.680
I can't...
My Bey is too heavy!

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:30.000
Takao!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.260
Show me what you've got!
Or do you wanna lose?!

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:40.050
I refuse to lose to him!

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:46.010
What?!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:49.640
What the hell was that?!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:50.930
It vanished!

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:52.610
It's a wave attack!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:53.900
Wave attack?

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:59.940
By initializing the Magne Weight Disk
and MG Core, he can move at high speeds!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.800
What a cheap trick.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:04.820
I'm just getting warmed up.

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.980
Go, Dragoon!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.070
Wave attack!

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.960
That won't work twice!

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:18.270
Wave attack!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.230
Keep it up, Takao!

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:24.980
I can't believe he mastered
Dragoon V2 so quickly!

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:26.760
Go, Dragoon!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.220
--Go, Shoot!

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:37.380
That's cheating!

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:41.350
I thought we said it
isn't a game anymore!

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:46.960
Go, Flash Leopard!

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:49.620
Vanishing Moot!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.060
Sharcrash!

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.620
Voltic Ape!

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:54.560
Darn...

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:57.480
Hurry up and summon Seiryu!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.760
And when you do,
that'll be the end of Seiryu.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:03.120
I would never give
Seiryu to you...

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.790
Then we'll force him out!

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:08.050
Cross Fire!

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.090
Now!

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:21.970
Who's there?!

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.110
Four on one isn't fair!

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:30.910
Who is he?

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.020
No clue...

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:35.780
We're leaving.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:39.940
We were just getting
to the good part, too...

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:42.370
Don't think we've given up.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:46.670
We will seal
your Sacred Beasts!

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:50.210
Are you okay?

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.680
Yeah.

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:57.270
Thanks. You saved me.

00:20:57.550 --> 00:20:59.600
I just did what anyone else would.

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:02.970
Takao! Is Dragoon V2 alright?

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.930
Yeah, it's fine. Don't worry.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:10.340
Takao...? Are you Takao
Kinomiya, the world champion?

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:12.590
Yeah, that's me...

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:15.130
Takao Kinomiya? Wow!

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:17.670
It's Takao Kinomiya, in the flesh!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.890
I've always wanted to meet you!

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:22.100
I'm so happy!

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:23.840
My name's Zeo!
Pleased to meet you!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.290
Nice to meet you.

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:28.270
Wow! You're the
real Takao Kinomiya!

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:32.380
Yeah, I'm the real deal...

00:22:59.170 --> 00:23:03.270
In the search for Doctor Zagart, a new enemy appears!

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:08.190
A mysterious Sacred Beast comes out from the Beyblade of Rei's opponent.

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:10.670
What are the origins
of this Sacred Beast?

00:23:10.670 --> 00:23:15.360
By the way, Chairman, how old were
you when you were with Doctor Zagart?

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:17.920
Hmm? "I was popular with
the ladies back then"?

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:19.440
I didn't ask that!

00:23:19.440 --> 00:23:22.090
Be sure to watch
next week as well!
